  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review of ACCSQ (ASEAN Consultative Committee on Standards and Quality) Strategic Plan 2016 &#x2013; 2025: Part 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to cover UK&apos;s support for a review of the implementation and results of the ACCSQ (ASEAN Consultative Committe on Standards and Quality) Strategic Plan 2016-2025, as part of the ASEAN Economic Integration Programme. It is intended that the results of the review will be utilised by ACCSQ in its development of the Strategic Plan Post 2025. 
This review would comprise of an evaluation of the implementation of the strategic plan through an examination of actions taken and outputs and results obtained.
This code is for the ODA part of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
